- parse/validate observation JSON (required fields missing → error)
- set endpoint validation (absolute http, length)
- city persistence, cache persistence
- fetch through loopback server returning fixture JSON (reuse serve-once pattern)
- unconfigured errors mention setup
- render formatting (e.g., "Berlin12.4°C  Partly cloudy  (feels 10.1°)  H14/L8  wind 14 km/h  hum 71%")

