// Declarative theme tokens. Rust (`mandala_ui::apply_theme`) overwrites the
// themed color/typography properties at runtime from the active JSON theme
// manifest; the values below mirror the default theme (minimalist-oled) and
// are the fallback used before the first theme is applied.
