**1. Every surface now has its own theme** (17 builtin app themes in [themes/apps/](themes/apps)):
*Atelier AI* (violet, soft) · *Horizon* (sky, weather) · *Frontpage* (rose, serif reading) · *Bloom* (lime, tasks) · *Library* (warm parchment) · *Studio* (orange, gallery) · *Spectrum* (mint mono, 2FA) · *Ship It* (periwinkle, LocalSend) · *Brass Pocket* (amber mono, calculator) · *Air Grid* (neutral, All Apps drawer) · *Heartbeat* (red mono, Overview monitor). The shell keys the two builtin overlays: All Apps → `app-drawer`, monitor → `app-monitor`, alongside the store from before. A new coverage test ([theme.rs](crates/mandala-core/src/theme.rs)) fails if any future slot is added without a manifest.

